# Code style (Importou)

- English for code identifiers, comments, and Swagger text.
- 2-space indent; Prettier when configured.
- Absolute imports `@src/...` only.
- Import order: Nest/framework → third-party → `@src`, blank line between groups.
- Object literals: prefer explicit `key: value` (no shorthand) when project ESLint requires it.
- Enums: string values matching DB (`ImportOperationStatus.Cancelled = "cancelled"`).
- JSDoc on public gateway/port methods when wrapping external APIs (Pay/KYB/Radar) — describe domain intent, not vendor names from other products.

$END$
